,"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/button","content":"Inside a field `Group`, `slot=\"control\"` and `slot=\"trigger\"` pick up the matching look, size, and\ndisabled state from context. See TextField for control affixes, and Select or DatePicker for trigger faces.\nThe `control` variant also works standalone, with its own size and rounded corners; inside a field, the\nfield sizes it and joins its corners. The `trigger` variant is a field part, so use it only inside a field."},"129":{"id":"/docs/components/button-12","page_id":"/docs/components/button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/button#examples","content":"import { Meta, ArgTypes } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/runtime';\nimport * as Stories from './button.stories.tsx';\n\n<Meta"},"130":{"id":"/docs/components/button-13","page_id":"/docs/components/button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/button#examples","content":"import { Meta, ArgTypes } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/runtime';\nimport * as Stories from './button.stories.tsx';\n\n\n\nUse the `LinkButton`"},"131":{"id":"/docs/components/button-14","page_id":"/docs/components/button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/button#examples","content":"import { Meta, ArgTypes } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/runtime';\nimport * as Stories from './button.stories.tsx';\n\n\n\nUse the `LinkButton` component"},"132":{"id":"/docs/components/calendar","page_id":"/docs/components/calendar","type":"page","content":"Calendar","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/calendar"},"133":{"id":"/docs/components/calendar-0","page_id":"/docs/components/calendar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/calendar","content":"Accessible calendar grids for selecting a single date (Calendar) or a date range (RangeC