ents/file-trigger-14","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#best-practices","content":"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."},"609":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-15","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#best-practices","content":"Pair `FileTrigger` with `DropZone` to offer both click-to-browse and drag-and-drop. See the DropZone \"File Upload\" example."},"610":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-16","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#best-practices","content":"Keep the child a single pressable element; `FileTrigger` forwards press behavior to whatever you nest inside it."},"611":{"id":"/docs/components/heading","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"page","content":"Heading","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading"},"612":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-0","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/heading","content":"Semantic h1-h6 heading. Use slot=\"title\" inside a Modal or Dialog to name the overlay."},"613":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-1","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#features","content":"Features"},"614":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-2","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#installation","content":"Installation"},"615":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-3","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#examples","content":"Examples"},"616":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-4","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#props","con