next to the indicator. `orientation` also sets keyboard-navigation direction and ARIA."},"1154":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-25","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#data-attributes","content":"Components automatically add data attributes for styling different states:"},"1155":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-26","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#data-attributes","content":"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"},"1156":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-27","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#data-attributes","content":"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"},"1157":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-28","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#component-customization","content":"Pass `className` or `style` to customize a radio field container. Use descendant data-attribute selectors to style the interactive radio state:"},"1158":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-29","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"},"1159":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-30","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"},"1160":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-31","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"},"1161":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-32","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Space**: Select the focused radio b