nded way to provide a contextual label that is also visible to sighted users."],[579,"**`aria-label`** — pass `aria-label` on the `DropZone` component to override or supplement the label (e.g. `aria-label=\"Upload profile photo\"`). When no `Text slot=\"label\"` is present and no `aria-label` is set, the button falls back to the default \"DropZone\" label provided by React Aria."],[1374,"**`ButtonGroup`** - a cluster of related actions (a wrapping row with `role=\"group\"`). Overlay parents like `Modal` adopt it with end alignment and padding."],[1371,"**`Content`** — the primary body region (a `<section>`, a column that grows to fill)."],[1376,"**`CornerActions`** - an always-visible structural row for actions placed at a surface corner."],[368,"**`FieldError`**: Displays validation error text below the group"],[1373,"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[1375,"**`Group`** — semantic grouping container for field item controls. A parent field injects the box chrome."],[1372,"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[681,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[680,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[688,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[689,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[687,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1553,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize. Without `size`, the lockup follows the\nsurrounding size scope. A tier is the same at every container width."],[1126,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[669,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[217,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[673,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1379,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1517,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1551,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[1159,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1281,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[932,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"],[931,"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"],[1160,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[232,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[666,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[720,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[228,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[227,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[671,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[230,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1631,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[318,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[744,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[266,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[261,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[263,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[262,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[742,"**Check icon name**: Ensure the icon exists in the CDN"],[265,"**Check scroll position**: The component accounts for horizontal scroll automatically"],[362,"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[361,"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[728,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"],[668,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[1516,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[525,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `DatePickerCalendar`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in. `children` also accepts a function for picker state"],[1303,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[990,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1305,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[899,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[739,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[897,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[994,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1307,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1519,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1552,"**Controls keep the scale size.** A `Button` inside a lockup follows the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` or its own `size` prop, never the lockup's tier."],[1518,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[835,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[215,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[214,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[270,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[727,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[212,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[729,"**DOM Output:**"],[674,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1547,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[745,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[733,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[718,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[667,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1310,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[721,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[229,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[241,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[244,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[233,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[834,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[825,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[696,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[736,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[213,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[367,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[366,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[236,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[898,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1630,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[269,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[732,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[231,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[749,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[235,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1520,"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry"],[743,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[1125,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[665,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[730,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[747,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[740,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1156,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[1155,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[900,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1311,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[854,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[731,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[726,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[211,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[242,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1632,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[216,"**RTL support**: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences _(in development)_"],[240,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[237,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1278,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1279,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1370,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[372,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[271,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[209,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1306,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[896,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[527,"**Sizes**: Each picker is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, trigger, description, error, and the calendar it opens; without it, the picker follows the surrounding scope"],[1522,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, description, error, and composed controls; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope. An explicit `size` on a part still wins for that part"],[992,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, steppers, description, and error; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope"],[1309,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets the label, trigger, and options, which open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"],[1161,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[371,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[930,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1282,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[725,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[735,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1378,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[991,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon and `variant=\"control\"` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[245,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[234,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[675,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[719,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[370,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[1158,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1280,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1550,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**